      "claim": "Rumi endured prolonged periods of deep sorrow, especially after the disappearance/death of his spiritual companion Shams‑e‑Tabrīzī.",
      "evidence": "The elegies to Shams in the *Divan‑e‑Shams*, letters compiled in *Maqālāt*, and biographical accounts describe months of mourning and intense grief.",
